-- mu-nonstructural: the plan's own negative (M1-PLAN.md:208).  The
-- body holds a self call at the argument itself, and no chain of
-- elimination legs makes that argument smaller, because the body
-- eliminates nothing.  The certificate of lib/order.ml therefore finds
-- no position that guards the call and the guard answers the
-- termination line of SI-D6, which the sidecar pins.
--
-- Mutation SI-M1 calls the translation without the guard, and then
-- this file is not refused with the line below.

mu N : Type 0 with
| zero : N
| succ : N -> N

def rec spin : N -> N := fun (n : N) => spin n
